                    {
                        "translation_id": "903d4caa-c39b-4db4-a8c2-d3da09431865",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1cff36b-919d-3864-af59-1d583e3215da",
                        "target_lang_word": "wokeness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wokeness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9d8c05b-7d51-3e16-ba88-9ff76f47372d",
                                        "entry_id": "0b308b07-585f-3b83-af9b-7e5537a4ff2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being woke."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang",
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "971e30cc-c6c6-4fa1-9937-d39d33027aac",
                                                "sense_id": "c9d8c05b-7d51-3e16-ba88-9ff76f47372d",
                                                "text": "Faux wokeness is the act of identifying yourself as an ally to people of color, but supporting color-blind, savior, or colonialistic approaches to activism. Faux wokeness ignores the intersectional, systemic, and institutional functions of racism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "867c9682-be3e-4873-8542-abbf7ea065ca",
                                                "sense_id": "c9d8c05b-7d51-3e16-ba88-9ff76f47372d",
                                                "text": "Justice Clarence Thomas served up a twofer last week: a Supreme Court decision, in Terry v. U.S., that’s noteworthy for its judicial restraint as well as for pushing back at another false racial narrative that has gained popularity in this Age of Wokeness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ffc907-5743-4ae1-9a10-2498ab2a0c23",
                                                "sense_id": "c9d8c05b-7d51-3e16-ba88-9ff76f47372d",
                                                "text": "What links these developments is a loose constellation of ideas that is changing the way that mostly white, educated, left-leaning Americans view the world. This credo still lacks a definitive name: it is variously known as left-liberal identity politics, social-justice activism or, simply, wokeness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2608294e-9bcd-4b7e-a8ac-84ba6ed08232",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1cff36b-919d-3864-af59-1d583e3215da",
                        "target_lang_word": "wokeism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wokeism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e0c4e12-28b3-3f25-97b8-7028f5c3ab65",
                                        "entry_id": "bd371e46-716a-3314-b6fa-ac168a7564c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The purported ideology of wokeness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0896005-873e-46ef-93ce-c86744b2ff70",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0c4e12-28b3-3f25-97b8-7028f5c3ab65",
                                                "text": "Ansari demonstrates how wokeism is both self-serving and self-perpetuating by simply acting as a vehicle for the privileged to “outwoke” each other while really doing nothing at all to change the reality which creates various forms of social inequality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb9bf5b7-baff-4f05-a846-9255fb1a53c6",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0c4e12-28b3-3f25-97b8-7028f5c3ab65",
                                                "text": "For my part, I have no problem with sports woke-ism. I never thought taking a knee was the most provocative social-justice statement. But I’m also a die-hard football fan who will sit through almost anything to watch Patrick Mahomes perform his magic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c18f6b21-9da4-312b-a628-d9dcaac8dbb9",
                                        "entry_id": "bd371e46-716a-3314-b6fa-ac168a7564c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woke word or expression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "943876e3-6aa6-4157-af66-f650ff77395d",
                                                "sense_id": "c18f6b21-9da4-312b-a628-d9dcaac8dbb9",
                                                "text": "Whereas companies once used the term \"civil rights movement\" when discussing issues of social justice, their language shifted in 2015 and became dominated by \"wokeisms\" such as \"allyship\" \"diversity equity,\" \"equity and inclusion,\" and \"racial justice.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fae94f50-7a95-4584-a95f-c9ccdabb6a27",
                                                "sense_id": "c18f6b21-9da4-312b-a628-d9dcaac8dbb9",
                                                "text": "Many of them are leaving us — the words. Gone into hiding […] Now they lurk, uncaged, behind other words, behind trending, brittle, bloodless little wokeisms […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57a19055-bb49-44b0-bc06-c28eb7ac7e7f",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1cff36b-919d-3864-af59-1d583e3215da",
